@startuml
title FR-17 - Finalize Laboratory Screening - Activity Diagram
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Laboratory Technician|
start
:Identify the donation;

|Server — Donations|
:Retrieve the donation, linked samples,\nand any earlier test results;

|Client|
:Display the donation, sample references,\nand existing results;

|Laboratory Technician|
:Verify the linked samples;
:Record or complete ABO/Rh\nand the required test results;
:Review the results;

if (Final laboratory decision?) then (Cleared)
  :Select final laboratory clearance;
else (Failed)
  :Record the failed laboratory decision\nand its reason;
endif

:Click the finalize button;

|Server — Donations|
:Check sample-to-donation links,\nrequired result completeness,\nthe reason if the decision is Failed,\nand any conflicting final decision;

if (Samples match, results complete,\nrequired reason present,\nand no conflicting final decision?) then (Yes)
  :Save the test results, ABO/Rh,\nand final laboratory decision,\nincluding the reason when Failed;
  :Retrieve the current recorded\nprocessing completion state;

  |Server — Inventory|
  :Retrieve all components of the donation\nand their stock context;

  while (Another donation component?) is (Yes)

    if (Laboratory decision is Failed?) then (Yes)
      :Set the current component to Unavailable;

    else (Cleared)
      if (Processing complete,\ncomponent accepted,\nand all stock rules satisfied?) then (Yes)
        :Set the current component to Available;
      else (No)
        :Set the current component to Unavailable;
      endif
    endif

    :Save the current component availability;
  endwhile (No)

  |Client|
  :Display the final laboratory decision\nand component statuses;
  stop

else (No)
  |Client|
  :Explain the finalization rejection;
  stop
endif

@enduml